---
const capabilities = [
	{ title: 'Custom design for your brand', desc: 'A clean, trustworthy look tailored to your business and customers—never a recycled template that looks like three other shops in town.' },
	{ title: 'Built to generate calls & leads', desc: 'Tap-to-call buttons, clear free-estimate and contact forms, and layouts structured around how local customers make decisions.' },
	{ title: 'Instant mobile speed', desc: 'Pages load in under a second on cell phones and rural connections, keeping impatient visitors from bouncing back to Google.' },
	{ title: 'Local Google & AI search structure', desc: 'Dedicated service pages, town coverage, and Google-ready business details built in from day one so search engines and AI assistants recommend you.' },
	{ title: 'Practical AI & automation', desc: 'Custom workflows and AI features that save your team real time—from review replies to CRM and intake automation.' },
	{ title: 'Accessible & durable', desc: 'High-contrast readability, full keyboard support, and zero fragile third-party plugins that break when you least expect it.' },
];

const check = '<svg class="mt-[3px] h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-leaf" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>';
---

<section id="services" class="relative border-t border-line py-24 sm:py-32">
	<div class="container-x">
		<div class="reveal max-w-3xl">
			<p class="eyebrow">What I deliver</p>
			<h2 class="display mt-5 text-[clamp(2.4rem,5.4vw,4.4rem)]">
				Websites, software, and <span class="serif-accent text-gradient">local setup.</span>
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-body">
				From the first sketch to launch day and ongoing updates, every project is designed and hand-built by me in Mishawaka.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-16 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-6">
			<!-- Websites -->
			<article id="website" class="spotlight card reveal flex scroll-mt-28 flex-col p-8 sm:p-10 lg:col-span-4 lg:row-span-2">
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
					<span class="text-xs text-muted">01 · Core Service</span>
					<span class="rounded-full bg-leaf/15 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-medium text-leaf">Starting at $500</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="display mt-8 text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3rem)]">Custom Website Design &amp; Development</h3>
				<p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-body">
					Custom, hand-built websites that look sharp, load in under a second on any phone, and turn local searches into phone calls and estimate requests. Whether you need a simple 1–3 page starter site or a full multi-page business site, every page is built from scratch.
				</p>
				<ul class="mt-8 grid gap-3 text-[0.95rem] text-body sm:grid-cols-2">
					<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Custom design tailored to your business (typically 5–8 pages)</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Mobile-first layout with persistent tap-to-call</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Local SEO &amp; Google-ready business details built in</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Lead/estimate forms, Analytics &amp; Search Console</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />2 rounds of revisions before launch</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />You own 100% of the finished website</li>
				</ul>

				<dl class="mt-auto grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-line bg-line pt-8 text-sm sm:grid-cols-3 [&>div]:bg-surface">
					<div class="p-4"><dt class="text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Typical scope</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 font-medium text-ink">5–8 custom pages</dd></div>
					<div class="p-4"><dt class="text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Typical timeline</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 font-medium text-ink">2–4 weeks to launch</dd></div>
					<div class="p-4"><dt class="text-[0.65rem] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Best for</dt><dd class="mt-1.5 font-medium text-ink">Contractors, shops &amp; small businesses</dd></div>
				</dl>
			</article>

			<!-- Software -->
			<article id="software" class="spotlight card reveal flex scroll-mt-28 flex-col p-8 lg:col-span-2">
				<span class="text-xs text-muted">02 · Custom Builds</span>
				<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Custom Websites &amp; Software</h3>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-body">
					Easy-to-update content editors, interactive restaurant menus and online ordering, appointment booking, client portals, and full-scale web software—like <a href="#rankradius" class="link-arrow">RankRadius</a> and <a href="/portfolio#hsc-portal" class="link-arrow">HSC Portal</a>.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-auto pt-6 text-[0.72rem] text-muted">Content editors · Online ordering · Portals · Custom apps</p>
			</article>

			<!-- Hosting -->
			<article id="hosting-maintenance" class="spotlight card reveal flex scroll-mt-28 flex-col p-8 lg:col-span-2">
				<div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
					<span class="text-xs text-muted">03 · Ongoing Care</span>
					<span class="text-xs font-semibold text-sky">$100/month</span>
				</div>
				<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Hosting &amp; Maintenance</h3>
				<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-body">
					I host the websites I build for businesses in Mishawaka and across Michiana, and include up to 1 hour per month of text, photo, or hours updates—so your site stays fast and current without you lifting a finger.
				</p>
				<p class="mt-auto pt-6 text-[0.72rem] text-muted">SSL security · Backups · 1 hr/mo updates included</p>
			</article>

			<!-- Google Business Profile setup -->
			<article id="google-business-profile" class="spotlight card reveal grid scroll-mt-28 gap-8 p-8 sm:p-10 lg:col-span-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.2fr]">
				<div>
					<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
						<span class="text-xs text-muted">04 · Local Search Foundation</span>
						<span class="rounded-full border border-line px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[0.68rem] font-semibold text-ink">$350 one-time · or bundled</span>
					</div>
					<h3 class="mt-6 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Google Business Profile Setup &amp; Handoff</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed text-body">
						A one-time setup so local customers find you on Google Search and Google Maps. I configure and optimize your profile to match your website, then hand it over with a walkthrough so you run it yourself.
					</p>
					<p class="mt-4 text-[0.92rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">
						This is a one-time setup and handoff, never an ongoing monthly retainer. Included in the <strong>Business Website + Local Launch</strong> package or available on its own for <strong>$350</strong>. Need help replying to customer reviews? Try my free <a href="/review-responder" class="link-arrow">AI Review Responder</a>.
					</p>
				</div>
				<ul class="grid gap-3 text-[0.95rem] text-body sm:grid-cols-2">
					<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Primary &amp; secondary category selection</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Services and Michiana service areas configured</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Hours, holiday hours &amp; business description</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Logo, cover &amp; work photos uploaded</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Name, address &amp; phone matched to your site</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Direct customer review-request link</li>
					<li class="flex gap-3 sm:col-span-2"><Fragment set:html={check} />1-on-1 handoff walkthrough so you control it forever</li>
				</ul>
			</article>

			<!-- RankRadius (optional add-on) -->
			<article id="rankradius" class="spotlight card reveal grid scroll-mt-28 gap-8 p-8 sm:p-10 lg:col-span-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] lg:items-center">
				<div>
					<span class="text-xs text-muted">05 · Optional Software Add-On</span>
					<p class="eyebrow mt-6">For contractors &amp; field-service businesses</p>
					<h3 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">RankRadius</h3>
					<p class="mt-3 max-w-xl leading-relaxed text-body">
						A local SEO automation platform I built and operate for field-service crews. It turns completed jobs from your CRM into neighborhood-level project write-ups (with your approval first), pairs them with matching 4- and 5-star Google reviews, posts to Facebook &amp; Instagram, and tracks your Google calls, clicks, and listing changes.
					</p>
					<ul class="mt-6 grid gap-3 text-[0.95rem] text-body sm:grid-cols-2">
						<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />CRM, Zapier, Make, or portal intake</li>
						<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Neighborhood pins (never customer houses)</li>
						<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Matched Google reviews &amp; 1-click social</li>
						<li class="flex gap-3"><Fragment set:html={check} />Performance dashboard &amp; daily listing watch</li>
					</ul>
					<a href="https://rankradius.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-ghost mt-8">Visit rankradius.io <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				</div>
				<div class="rounded-xl border border-line bg-paper p-5" aria-hidden="true">
					<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
						<span class="text-[0.62rem] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-muted">Website widget · live example</span>
						<span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[0.62rem] text-leaf"><span class="h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-leaf"></span>Published</span>
					</div>
					<p class="mt-3 text-[0.95rem] font-medium leading-snug text-ink">Roof repair in Harter Heights, South Bend</p>
					<p class="mt-1.5 text-[0.8rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">Wind-lifted shingles along the ridge replaced and sealed the same afternoon.</p>
					<p class="mt-2.5 text-[0.75rem] text-gold">★★★★★ <span class="text-muted">matched customer review</span></p>
				</div>
			</article>
		</div>

		<ul class="mt-6 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
			{capabilities.map((c) => (
				<li class="spotlight card reveal p-6">
					<h3 class="font-semibold text-ink">{c.title}</h3>
					<p class="mt-2 text-[0.92rem] leading-relaxed text-muted">{c.desc}</p>
				</li>
			))}
		</ul>

		<p class="reveal mt-10 text-center text-body">
			Clear packages with upfront pricing. <a href="#pricing" class="link-arrow">See package pricing <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
		</p>
	</div>
</section>
